        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>4 1/2\" x 4 1/2\" x Square Corners Heavy Duty Commercial Door Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nExtra heavy duty (0.180\" thick) commercial  door hinge with 4 ball bearings and Non-Removable Pin. <b>Conforms to ANSI A8111</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-HWBB74545_size.gif?v=1704354574\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo HWBB74545 hinge size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a  Non-Removable Pin (NRP) for security.\r\n Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo HWBB74545 Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.180\" (Extra Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>4 Ball Bearings for Smooth Action</li>\r\n<li>Non-Removable Hinge Pin</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Conforms to ANSI A8111</li>\r\n<li> Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/HWBB74545.pdf?v=1704262302\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo HWBB74545 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with machine screws and wood screws. For use with  heavy metal or wood doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4-1/2 x 4-1/2 Extra Heavy Duty Non-Removable Pin Hinge",
                "description": "Don-Jo HWBB74545 Extra heavy duty (0.180 thick) commercial  door hinge with 4 ball bearings and Non-Removable Pin. Conforms to ANSI A8111. Fitted with a high grade, Non-Removable pin for security.\r\n Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors. Available in Bright Brass, Oil Rubbed Bronze, Bright Chrome or Brushed Chrome finish.",
